      en: ["Founded on February 12, 1541, near the Mapocho River.", "The Santiago Metropolitan Region houses over 7 million people.", "Home to the Gran Torre Santiago, the tallest building in South America at 300 meters.", "Features the largest urban park in Chile, Parque Metropolitano.", "The city's metro system is the most extensive in South America.", "Located at an average elevation of 520 meters above sea level."]
